      "harness_note": "Orchestrator wrapper injected round-aware framing into every role prompt: the round number, the prior rounds' finding counts and that all were resolved fixed, a summary of what the last revision changed, an instruction not to re-report genuinely fixed findings or 'not implemented yet' findings, and — from round 3 on — the sentence 'an empty round is the expected and desired outcome; report only defects you would defend under challenge, do not manufacture findings'. Rounds 1-3 carried equivalent framing but recorded no harness_note, so they are not strictly comparable to this one. Roles also received runtime setup tp cannot know (codedbpro instead of hook-blocked native file tools, absolute output paths) and a per-role list of relevant source/test files."
    },
